2186298446 #edb/ref 1080 "26" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186298446 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186298446 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "cd440cb0-4f36-544e-b800-2b632f84913a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186299188 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186298446 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186299188 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186299188 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186299188 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186298446 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186299188 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "a4386ef2-d375-5d83-9422-3a383082baa8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186299851 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186299188 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186299851 #edb/ref 1069 "q-320414" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186299851 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186299851 #edb/ref 1071 "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=⟨5,-3⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨-2,-4⟩.$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186299851 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "216d9367-5418-5e10-afd0-533eb5320c38" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186299851 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =5\\cdot (-4)-(-2)\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =-20-6 \\\\  & =-26\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-26\\,|=26\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358414 #edb/ref 1080 "f:x↦{x}^{2}+{x}^{3}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358414 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358414 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "4c7cd51d-90dc-5dc9-a419-e7b634bbc656" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358420 #edb/ref 1080 "f:{x}^{2}↦x+{x}^{3}" #edb/ref 175921